  "description": "Recording R-314 (decision 314, phase3.1_unreal-gltf-pbr-preset item 2.1) on the authored bevelled cube at 256 px, OpenGL, the shipped template 'templates/PBR - Metallic Roughness Alpha-blend.spt' with AO and SpecularWeight added, under Legacy: normal-b bound as the Normal mesh map and grey A as AO; one fill with field A on BaseColor, grey A on roughness, grey B on metalness, the height ramps, normal-a, the hue-grid grey on Opacity, field B on EmissionColor, the transposed hue-grid grey on AO and grey 173 on SpecularWeight. Captures: the predefined and resource export presets, every predefined preset's output maps on the set, and the output maps of the starter glTF PBR Metal Roughness preset. Probes: that preset with its own parameters and with the pipeline's (PNG 16, infinite, no dithering). Confirms or corrects every map of the shipped gltf-pbr-metal-roughness preset (assets/export-presets/), its channels, its name, its parameters and its URL.",
